meta {
  name: Reference - Check IP Country (ip-api direct)
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: http://ip-api.com/json/{{usIp}}?fields=57346&lang=en
  body: none
  auth: none
}

docs {
  Not part of this service's API — calls ip-api.com directly (same call the app makes) so you can
  confirm what country a test IP currently resolves to before asserting SUCCESS vs
  COUNTRY_NOT_ALLOWED below. Swap {{usIp}} for {{otherCountryIp}} in the URL to check the other one;
  ip-api's answer for a given IP can drift over time, so re-check if the activation assertions start
  failing.
}